hapter-065","block":"b-a7538fff8b967c64021b","layer":"original","quote":"玄一身随奕讨贼〖18〗，持刀步涉；见奕辄拜，奕未忍杀","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":41,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-bfecf32fa6e5200ee9ca","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-33f46caab52802f3c5e3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《江表传》曰：“皓遣将张奕，追赐玄鸩；奕以玄贤者，不忍即宣诏致药。玄阴知之，谓奕曰：‘当早告玄，玄何惜邪！’即服药死。”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d06f42d86dcf2007353b","start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-fbd2c4cec6f85f1c3501","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-38722480a2c5d0cb88c4","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以玄之清高，必不以安危易操；无缘骤拜张奕，以亏其节。且祸机既发，岂百拜所免？《江表传》所言，于理为长。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d06f42d86dcf2007353b","start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
